  "limits": [
    "Vase Ambush is five finite I,Zombie puzzles using original vases, a fixed army and player release timing. Original plant/zombie statistics, native controls, previous modes, artwork and saved object layouts are retained. Earlier Endless acceptance gates remain unchanged and execute freshly.",
    "Synthetic controls and developer checkpoints do not count as earned progress. Native raster tests are not GPU/browser parity proof. Muted browser validation and public deployment are recorded separately. Full original-game parity remains unverified."
  ]
